1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,015
Hello everyone and welcome back to the channel
大家好，欢迎回到本频道

2
00:00:04,015 --> 00:00:06,320
Many roads lead to rome
条条大路通罗马

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:11,700
But only a few lead to interactive foliage in unreal engine
但只有少数几条能通向虚幻引擎中的交互式植被

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:15,190
There are multiple ways like world position offset
有多种方式，比如世界位置偏移（WPO）

5
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:18,560
Pivot painter or skeletal mesh systems
Pivot Painter 或骨骼网格体系统

6
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:22,120
in this video we'll focus on a simple and lightweight
本期视频我们将重点介绍一种简单且轻量级的

7
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:26,372
World position offset based setup for gress interaction
基于世界位置偏移的草地交互方案

8
00:00:26,372 --> 00:00:30,962
While i'm already working on a separate pivot painter tutorial
另外，我已经在制作一期单独的 Pivot Painter 教程

9
00:00:30,962 --> 00:00:35,682
World position offset is part of the material system
世界位置偏移属于材质系统的一部分

10
00:00:35,682 --> 00:00:41,025
For example , wind effects are typically created using wp o
例如，风效果通常就是使用 WPO 制作的

11
00:00:41,025 --> 00:00:47,122
most quicks of foliage assets already use the internal ms foliage material
大多数植被资源包已经使用了内置的 MS Foliage 植被材质

12
00:00:47,122 --> 00:00:49,447
Where the wind is set up
其中已经设置好了风效果

13
00:00:49,447 --> 00:00:54,380
You can simply add today's interaction to the existing wp o
你只需把今天讲的交互添加到现有的 WPO 中

14
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:57,775
and plug it back into the world position offset
再把它重新接入世界位置偏移

15
00:00:57,775 --> 00:01:00,870
Or use it in your own material setup
或者将其用于你自己的材质设置中

16
00:01:00,870 --> 00:01:04,642
Our grass should only react when the player is close
我们的草地应该只在玩家靠近时产生反应

17
00:01:04,642 --> 00:01:08,990
So we need a mask based on the player's position
因此我们需要一个基于玩家位置的遮罩

18
00:01:08,990 --> 00:01:12,800
Since we can't access the player directly in the material
由于在材质中无法直接访问玩家

19
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:17,457
We sent the position through a material parameter collection
我们通过材质参数集来传递位置

20
00:01:17,457 --> 00:01:21,010
Open it and add a new vector parameter
打开它并添加一个新的向量参数

21
00:01:21,010 --> 00:01:23,410
And name it player position
将其命名为 Player Position

22
00:01:23,410 --> 00:01:25,860
Now open your player blueprint
现在打开你的玩家蓝图

23
00:01:25,860 --> 00:01:27,190
In the event graph
在事件图表中

24
00:01:27,190 --> 00:01:30,450
Add a set vector parameter value note
添加一个“设置向量参数值”节点

25
00:01:30,450 --> 00:01:36,430
Select your collection and choose player position for the value use
选择你的参数集，并为数值选择 Player Position

26
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:38,430
Get act or location
使用“获取 Actor 位置”

27
00:01:38,430 --> 00:01:41,830
This automatically converts the position into a format
这会自动将位置转换为一种格式

28
00:01:41,830 --> 00:01:43,920
the material can read
让材质能够读取

29
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:46,680
Connected to event tick
连接到事件 Tick

30
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:50,870
But don't worry . updating a single parameter like this
但别担心，像这样更新单个参数

31
00:01:50,870 --> 00:01:54,057
Has no no to sybil performance impact
不会造成明显的性能影响

32
00:01:54,057 --> 00:01:58,900
Now open your grass material and add a collection parameter
现在打开你的草地材质，并添加一个集合参数

33
00:01:58,900 --> 00:01:59,830
Note
节点

34
00:01:59,830 --> 00:02:04,030
Sign your collection and select player position
选择你的集合，并选中 Player Position

35
00:02:04,030 --> 00:02:07,562
We only need x , y and z values
我们只需要 X、Y 和 Z 值

36
00:02:07,562 --> 00:02:10,930
So right click and add a component mask
所以右键单击并添加一个组件蒙版

37
00:02:10,930 --> 00:02:14,700
Note : then enable r , g and b
节点，然后启用 R、G 和 B

38
00:02:14,700 --> 00:02:18,010
Right click and search for world's position
右键单击并搜索 World Position

39
00:02:18,010 --> 00:02:20,890
This will add an absolute world position
这会添加一个绝对世界位置

40
00:02:20,890 --> 00:02:26,920
Note : then subtract the player's position from it using a subtract node
节点，然后使用减法节点从中减去玩家位置

41
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:32,260
This gives us the direction vector from the grass to the player
这样我们就得到了从草指向玩家的方向向量

42
00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:37,000
Now we calculate the distance using a vector length note
现在用Vector Length节点计算距离

43
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:40,260
Then divided by a scale of parameter
然后除以一个缩放参数

44
00:02:40,260 --> 00:02:42,635
To control the size of the effect
来控制影响范围的大小

45
00:02:42,635 --> 00:02:47,420
Name it radius and sets the default value to around one hundred
把它命名为Radius，默认值设为100左右

46
00:02:49,350 --> 00:02:53,450
Now we use a power note to shape the fall off
接着用Power节点来塑造衰减曲线

47
00:02:53,450 --> 00:02:58,562
So the transition becomes smoother or sharper depending on the value
这样过渡会随数值变得更平滑或更锐利

48
00:02:58,562 --> 00:03:03,370
Promote the exponent to a parameter and name it fall off
把指数提升为参数，命名为Falloff

49
00:03:03,370 --> 00:03:06,140
For now we set the value to one
暂时先把值设为1

50
00:03:08,070 --> 00:03:15,137
Then we clamp the result using saturrate to keep it in a clean zero to one range
然后用Saturate钳制结果，保持在干净的0到1范围内

51
00:03:15,137 --> 00:03:18,850
And finally we inverted using one minus
最后用1减去它来做反转

52
00:03:18,850 --> 00:03:23,880
So the effect is the strongest close to the player and fates outwards
这样效果在玩家附近最强，向外逐渐衰减

53
00:03:24,910 --> 00:03:26,900
Now that our mask is ready
现在遮罩已经准备好了

54
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:29,200
We first pushed the grass down
我们先让草向下压

55
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:31,590
Where the player is standing
在玩家站立的位置

56
00:03:31,590 --> 00:03:36,160
At a scale of parameter name it z offset
用一个缩放参数，命名为Z Offset

57
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:39,720
And set it to around negative fifty
把它设为-50左右

58
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:44,305
Then right click and search for make vector three
然后右键搜索Make Vector3

59
00:03:44,305 --> 00:03:47,430
Pluck the scale of value into the b input
把缩放值连到B输入

60
00:03:47,430 --> 00:03:50,805
And set r and g to zero
并把R和G设为0

61
00:03:50,805 --> 00:03:53,790
Then multiplied this vector or with a mask
然后用遮罩乘以这个向量

62
00:03:53,790 --> 00:03:58,187
So only the area inside the radius gets affected
这样只有半径内的区域会受到影响

63
00:03:58,187 --> 00:04:03,072
Now pluck the result into the world's position offset
现在把结果连到World Position Offset

64
00:04:03,072 --> 00:04:08,250
If there is already a wind setup at your result on top of it
如果已经有风的效果，就叠加在它上面

65
00:04:08,250 --> 00:04:12,450
Otherwise plug it directly into the wp o
否则直接连到WPO

66
00:04:12,450 --> 00:04:14,912
Now we can test it
现在可以测试一下

67
00:04:14,912 --> 00:04:16,380
It works
生效了

68
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:19,339
The grass is pushed down by the player
草被玩家压下去了

69
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:23,285
Now let's add bending
接下来添加弯曲效果

70
00:04:23,285 --> 00:04:27,920
We take the result from our earlier distance calculation
我们取之前距离计算的结果

71
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:31,325
The world position minus the player position
也就是世界位置减去玩家位置

72
00:04:31,325 --> 00:04:37,480
Then we multiply it with a constant three vector or set to one one zero
然后乘以一个常量向量，设为110

73
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:41,220
So we only affect x and y but ignore a z
这样只影响X和Y，忽略Z

74
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:47,137
After that we normalized the result to keep the direction clean
之后对结果做归一化，保持方向干净

75
00:04:47,137 --> 00:04:50,870
Then we multiply it with a bent strength parameter
再乘以一个弯曲强度参数

76
00:04:50,870 --> 00:04:53,390
To control how strong the effect is
用来控制效果的强度

77
00:04:54,470 --> 00:04:58,950
We'll use a starting value of around fifty for the band strength
弯曲强度的起始值用50左右

78
00:04:58,950 --> 00:05:03,410
Next at a linear gradient note from this node
接下来从这个节点接一个LinearGradient节点

79
00:05:03,410 --> 00:05:05,860
We used a v gradient output
我们使用V方向渐变输出

80
00:05:05,860 --> 00:05:10,530
Since it gives us the vertical gradient from button to top
因为它能给出从下到上的垂直渐变

81
00:05:10,530 --> 00:05:13,730
then we invert it using one minus
然后我们用 1 减去它来反转

82
00:05:13,730 --> 00:05:20,322
Because we want the grass to stay stable at the bottom and only bent towards the top
因为我们希望草在底部保持稳定，只在顶部弯曲

83
00:05:20,322 --> 00:05:24,080
After that , we multiply it with our band multiplier
之后，我们将它与弯曲倍数相乘

84
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:27,092
To control the strength of the effect
来控制效果的强度

85
00:05:27,092 --> 00:05:30,410
Now we multiplied this with our mask
现在我们把它与遮罩相乘

86
00:05:30,410 --> 00:05:32,030
So the banding only happens
这样弯曲就只会发生在

87
00:05:32,030 --> 00:05:34,290
insight the interaction radius
交互半径之内

88
00:05:36,110 --> 00:05:38,590
Then we added to our z offset
然后我们把它加到 Z 偏移上

89
00:05:38,590 --> 00:05:42,030
combining both effects into the final result
将两种效果结合成最终结果

90
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:51,220
In the material instance
在材质实例中

91
00:05:51,220 --> 00:05:55,560
You can now easily tweak all parameters like ben's strength
你现在可以轻松调整所有参数，比如弯曲强度

92
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:59,280
Z offset and radius to adjust the effect
Z 偏移和半径，来调节效果

93
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:03,350
This works really well for grass and small foliage
这非常适合草和小型植被

94
00:06:03,350 --> 00:06:09,160
While larger plants or trees are usually better handled with pivot painter setups
而更大的植物或树木通常更适合用 Pivot Painter 设置来处理

95
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:13,832
Edit tutorial for exactly that is already in progress
关于这一点的教程已经在制作中了

96
00:06:13,832 --> 00:06:16,042
That's it for today
今天就到这里

97
00:06:16,042 --> 00:06:18,980
I hope you liked it and it was helpful
希望你喜欢，也对你有帮助

98
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:21,320
If you want more tutorials like this
如果你想看更多这样的教程

99
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:22,970
Just leave a comment
就留个评论吧

100
00:06:22,970 --> 00:06:23,680
Cheers
下次见
